  "details": "When a player leaves the instance while we are joining the world, we receive OnPlayerLeft() for that player, even though we never received OnPlayerJoined() for that player.\n\nThis confuses Udon scripts that try to keep track of all players in the instance and requires us to add additional error handling for an error that should never happen.",
